{
 "id": "story-daniel-og-vennene-i-babel-hiphop",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/story-daniel-og-vennene-i-babel-hiphop",
 "offset_seconds": -4.04000000000017,
 "words_heard": 215,
 "words": 223,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Taken from Jerusalem, dropped in Babylon",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 22.47,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "New name, new tongue, they want the old me gone",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 24.22,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Kings table spread with the richest wine and meat",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 26.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Daniel made up his mind, that is food I won't eat",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 28.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Asked the chief official, give us ten days of greens",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 54.3,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Water and vegetables, then see what it means",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 55.92,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "If we look worse than the boys who eat the king's food",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 58.49,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Do what you want, but give us ten days to prove",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 59.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm in Babylon but I'm not of it",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 62.53,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They can change my name but they can't change my heart",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 63.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I won't bow down, I won't be bought",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 58.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "In Babylon, I still belong to God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 52.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten days later, look at them, they shine",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 46.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Healthier and stronger than the ones who drank the wine",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 43.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "God gave them knowledge, wisdom, every skill in a book",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 41.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Daniel understood the visions and the dreams they took",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 38.96,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The king put them to the test with every question he had",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 36.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten times better than the magicians in his land",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 33.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So when the world says blend in, take the easy road",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 31.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Remember four young men who would not let go",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 28.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm in Babylon but I'm not of it",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 25.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They can change my name but they can't change my heart",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 19.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I won't bow down, I won't be bought",
   "heard": 7,
